      "number": 17,
      "answer": "(1) $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 16 \\end{pmatrix}$, $B=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 8 \\end{pmatrix}$ (2) $3B-A=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 18 \\end{pmatrix}$",
      "solution": "(1) $a_{11}=\\sqrt{2^{2}}=2$, $a_{12}=(1-2)^{3}=-1$\n$a_{21}=(2-1)^{2}=1$, $a_{22}=\\sqrt{4^{4}}=16$\n따라서 $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 16 \\end{pmatrix}$이다.\n$b_{11}=\\frac{1}{2}a_{11}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 2=1$, $b_{12}=a_{12}=-1$\n$b_{21}=a_{21}=-1$, $b_{22}=\\frac{1}{2}a_{22}=8$\n따라서 $B=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 8 \\end{pmatrix}$이다.\n(2) $3B-A=3\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 16 \\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 8 \\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 18 \\end{pmatrix}$이다.",
      "topic": "",
      "difficulty": ""
    },
